  "adaptation": "Original dynamite/sticky/remote roles and icons; original full six-face Industrial TNT atlas. Four-second thrown/manual fuse, two-second remote fuse; sixteen UUID-bound remote links with loaded same-dimension 64-block range. Industrial TNT has a four-block bounded burst rather than dynamite two-block burst, with retained block drops. Blasts recheck owner/claims, skip inventories, liquids, TNT and high resistance. Bound dynamite dispenser automation is supported. No unrestricted legacy explosion or nuclear-device parity."
